Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 19:30:38 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] CHAIN: MoonBite mainnet, testnet, regtest genesis blocks
 baked; branding to MoonBite Core

- Genesis: MAIN nonce 2744921, TESTNET 284742, REGTEST 8 (all RandomX-verified)
- Consensus: 50 MBITE subsidy, 330,000-block halving, 600s target, ~33M cap
- Treasury: zeroed on all 3 networks (ADR-007: no protocol revenue)
- Branding: configure.ac updated; seed nodes cleared for production setup
- Binary names: moonbited, moonbite-cli, moonbite-qt, etc.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
